'''Kathy''' (Japanese: '''キャシー''' ''Kathy'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[JN139|Must Be Our Heroes and the Witch!]]''.

Kathy runs a café in [[Stow-on-Side]] and met {{Ash}}, {{AP|Pikachu}}, and {{an|Misty}} when they visited her café for food. When they were impressed with her food, she called out her chef who turned out to be their former [[Ash's friends|traveling companion]] {{an|Brock}}. Brock had fallen in love with Kathy but was heartbroken when Kathy revealed that she already had a fiancé. After learning this, Brock left her café and joined Ash and Misty on their journey.

A {{pkmn2|wild}} {{p|Hatterene}} would later create a vision of Kathy to make Brock follow her.

